# P6 web-scraping-pipeline: example crontab (install with `crontab -e`).
# Cron uses the SYSTEM timezone (this WSL: Africa/Cairo), so 05:00 below = 05:00 Cairo time.
# The app itself always stores UTC.
# Requirements: cron service running (`sudo service cron start` if WSL has no systemd),
# Docker Desktop running on Windows.
#
# m  h  dom mon dow  command
  0  5  *   *   1    $HOME/projects/web-scraping-pipeline/deploy/run_scheduled.sh >> $HOME/projects/web-scraping-pipeline/outputs/logs/cron.log 2>&1
# Daily quick check (20 books):
# 30 6  *   *   *    $HOME/projects/web-scraping-pipeline/deploy/run_scheduled.sh --limit 20 >> $HOME/projects/web-scraping-pipeline/outputs/logs/cron.log 2>&1
